  "content": "<div class=\"breadcrumbs\" typeof=\"BreadcrumbList\" vocab=\"https://schema.org/\">\n<span property=\"itemListElement\" typeof=\"ListItem\"><a property=\"item\" typeof=\"WebPage\" title=\"Go to The Beatles’ songs –&nbsp;complete A-Z list.\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/\" class=\"post post-page\"><span property=\"name\">The Beatles’ songs –&nbsp;complete A-Z list</span></a><meta property=\"position\" content=\"1\"></span> » <span property=\"itemListElement\" typeof=\"ListItem\"><span property=\"name\" class=\"post post-page current-item\">Nobody I Know</span><meta property=\"url\" content=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/nobody-i-know/\"><meta property=\"position\" content=\"2\"></span></div><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p></p><main><a href=\"/gallery/miscellany/peter-and-gordon-nobody-i-know_uk/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-100214\"><img decoding=\"sync\" data-attachment-id=\"100214\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/miscellany/peter-and-gordon-nobody-i-know_uk/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/peter-and-gordon-nobody-i-know_uk.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1280,1260\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Peter And Gordon –&nbsp;Nobody I Know single (UK)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/peter-and-gordon-nobody-i-know_uk-960x945.jpg\" src=\"/wp/media/peter-and-gordon-nobody-i-know_uk-200x197.jpg\" alt=\"Peter And Gordon –&nbsp;Nobody I Know single (UK)\" width=\"200\" height=\"197\" class=\"alignright size-thumbnail wp-image-100214\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/peter-and-gordon-nobody-i-know_uk-200x197.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/peter-and-gordon-nobody-i-know_uk-580x571.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/peter-and-gordon-nobody-i-know_uk-960x945.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/peter-and-gordon-nobody-i-know_uk-768x756.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/peter-and-gordon-nobody-i-know_uk-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/peter-and-gordon-nobody-i-know_uk.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a>Written by <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a>, ‘Nobody I Know’ was the second single by British duo Peter And Gordon. <span id=\"more-65042\"></span><p></p><p>The song was the follow-up to the transatlantic hit <a href=\"/songs/a-world-without-love/\">‘A World Without Love’</a>. Although it did not repeat the success of its predecessor, ‘Nobody I Know’ reached number 10 in the UK and 12 in the USA.</p><div class=\"epyt-video-wrapper\"><iframe id=\"_ytid_97744\" width=\"580\" height=\"435\" data-origwidth=\"580\" data-origheight=\"435\" data-relstop=\"1\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5YQVifZ6tsk?enablejsapi=1&amp;autoplay=0&amp;cc_load_policy=0&amp;cc_lang_pref=&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;loop=0&amp;rel=0&amp;fs=1&amp;playsinline=0&amp;autohide=2&amp;theme=dark&amp;color=red&amp;controls=1&amp;disablekb=0&amp;\" class=\"__youtube_prefs__  epyt-is-override  no-lazyload\" title=\"YouTube player\" allow=\"fullscreen; accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-no-lazy=\"1\" data-skipgform_ajax_framebjll=\"\"></iframe></div><blockquote><div>Paul again. That was his <a href=\"/people/jane-asher/\">Jane Asher</a> period, I believe.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\"><a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a>, 1980<br>\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/allwearesaying\" target=\"_blank\"><em>All We Are Saying</em></a>, David Sheff</div><p>Other songs by McCartney that were recorded by Peter And Gordon included <a href=\"/songs/i-dont-want-to-see-you-again/\">‘I Don’t Want To See You Again’</a> and <a href=\"/songs/woman/\">‘Woman’</a>.</p></main></div><div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Published:</strong> <time itemprop=\"datePublished\" datetime=\"2021-10-11T10:20:38+01:00\" content=\"2021-10-11T10:20:38+01:00\">11 October 2021 </time> | <time itemprop=\"dateModified\" datetime=\"2023-03-01T16:03:09+00:00\" content=\"2023-03-01T16:03:09+00:00\"><strong>Last updated:</strong> 1 March 2023</time></div>",
  "textContent": "The Beatles’ songs – complete A-Z list » Nobody I KnowWritten by Paul McCartney, ‘Nobody I Know’ was the second single by British duo Peter And Gordon. The song was the follow-up to the transatlantic hit ‘A World Without Love’. Although it did not repeat the success of its predecessor, ‘Nobody I Know’ reached number 10 in the UK and 12 in the USA.Paul again. That was his Jane Asher period, I believe.John Lennon, 1980\nAll We Are Saying, David SheffOther songs by McCartney that were recorded by Peter And Gordon included ‘I Don’t Want To See You Again’ and ‘Woman’.Published: 11 October 2021  | Last updated: 1 March 2023",
